        "kind": "json_list_count",
        "file": "extract/sources.json",
        "key": "sources"
      },
      "note": "the sixteenth report (C23): the page said 567 in one place and 600 in another; the catalogue's length is the list's"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalogue.total-licence-line",
      "kind": "number",
      "doc": "{city}/docs/README.md",
      "pattern": "of the\\n([\\d,]+) catalogue entries carry `Government publication; reuse terms unverified`",
      "truth": {
        "kind": "json_list_count",
        "file": "extract/sources.json",
        "key": "sources"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "catalogue.government-unverified",
      "kind": "number",
      "doc": "{city}/docs/README.md",
      "pattern": "licence; ([\\d,]+) of the\\n[\\d,]+ catalogue entries carry `Government publication; reuse terms unverified`",
      "truth": {
        "kind": "json_list_count",
        "file": "extract/sources.json",
        "key": "sources",
        "match": {"licence": "Government publication; reuse terms unverified"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validation.per-mode-targets",
      "kind": "number",
      "doc": "{city}/docs/README.md",
      "pattern": "\\| Validation \\| \\*\\*([\\d,]+) per-mode targets\\*\\*",
      "truth": {
        "kind": "manifest_artefact_rows",
        "path": "data/processed/validation/mode_targets_by_mode.csv"
